{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01444","headline":"相和歌辞 采莲曲 · 李白","name":"相和歌辞 采莲曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若耶溪边采莲女，笑隔荷花共人语。\n日照新妆水底明，风飘香袖空中举。\n岸上谁家游冶郎，三三五五映垂杨。\n紫骝嘶入落花去，见此踟蹰空断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}